ere<P>We will have the biggest recession in the history of the WORLD<P>Then there will be a Great War and were all gonna dieeeeeeee.<P>And the worst of all the remaining people are going to have to sell our fiero’s for food just to survive<P>Just a year ago we had the best economy ever!<P><BR>||||reg||1
