Z||000025||BAM-BAM||01-01-2001||02:12 AM||||  Actually it took years of thought and alot of mistakes to completely understand where we as a poeple are and how we got here. It's not irreparable but it will take a social awakening to get the ball rolling in the right direction. The fact that we live in a victim laiden and litigious society doesn't help matters any.  I try every day, to reach out to one person, deserving or not and lend myself in whatever way I can. It's important to me to know that I have done at least one good deed for that day. I also try to be as fair as I can in every endeavor. I'm not perfect and I have my bad days, but you'll always know where I stand with you. Another fait that has befallen this country is the lack of GOD in our society. God is many things to many people and because of the variety of beliefs, we choose not to honor any one belief. So goes our justice system, enabling people the right to practice their perversions and sicknesses under the guise of constitutional right. Lest we forget the rights of the Constitution Of The United States was based on a belief in GOD. With the seperation of church and state, we embarked on a path to an imoral society and here we are. What's up with the fact that your child may practice homosexuality in school, but we may not pray for fear of offending someone? Seems kind of back asswards to me. Why is it that a sixteen year old boy can or would, stand up in your face and curse you and you have no recourse? Why is it that children can divorce their parents and have their parents arrested without due cause, just to inflict pain? We have lost it as a society and no one wants to be responsible. The movie makers don't feel they are resposible, the record makers don't think they are influential, The networks carry no burden of responsibility. They lay it all on the parents. The parents, that in todays society have to both work and relegte their children to child care or after school programs. The parents that have to do this in order to provide any kind of lifestyle in a greedy world where everyone wants more for less but gets less for more. It stars with us and it can end with us. But first, we must become aware. Awareness is the key to all solutions. When aware of the variables and costants and what results of the proper combinations, then, and only then can balance and harmony be restored. <P> Peace, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> ||||reg||12
